                  Parameters for VMODEL
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
vmodel.var   \file for variogram output
2 20   \number of directions and lags
0 0 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
90 0 2   \azm, dip, lag distance
1 0.1   \nst, nugget effect
4 0.5 0 0 0   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
1.5 1.5 1.5   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
